Assessment

A bounded independent 3D MHD constrained-transport control is technically feasible
with the pinned dependency. It is not available by enabling -b in the current
hydro wrapper. Correct evolving WSA magnetic driving requires a modest new problem
generator plus an explicit stage-aware boundary-EMF hook in an isolated dependency
copy, a compatible target-grid surface solve/remap, and magnetic energy/divergence
validation. That is a separate implementation and validation task. Keep it as a
fallback while the conservative HLLE escape is assessed; this review does not
justify starting a major second simulation campaign.

What exists and what is missing

The source is PrincetonUniversity/athena, pinned commit
